      "title": "Eclipse world self-calculation research machine",
      "subtitle": "RN-ASR · Experimental and Formal Research",
      "description": "[
        \"Tested object: Imitation Herrscher Core of Corrosion x 1; Paper 2 is used for testing records, and the reference sample is recycled\",
        \"Complete the team's experiment at the Civilization Engineering Acceptance Center. The actual energy consumption is limited to the benchmark calculation, and the results can be repeatedly checked and verified. It can be stopped; no rewards for completed projects will be re-awarded without accelerating the project first; the original amount of the inspected object will be returned, and the experiment will be based on the actual settlement of the machine.\",
        \"After the experiment is completed, choose 9690 research points or CIV circuit × 10, tri-titanium plate × 144 to pay the base fee; an additional 51,000 ticks and 2,161,727,821,137,838,080 EU/t are required. The current material pressure is corrected for advanced ones.\",
        \"The research institute deducts power according to the total power of the effective energy port. After completion, the Herrscher of Corrosion, Eclipse World, and Self-Calculation Research Machine will be unlocked; the Herrscher of Corrosion, Eclipse World, and Self-Calculation Research Machine can not be used to accelerate it as a prerequisite for developing the Herrscher of Corrosion, Eclipse World, and Self-Calculation Research Machine itself.\"
